OL,3,AHow much is the minimum wage?
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe official minimum rates of pay will
OL,6,Frise for 2.3 million workers on 1
OL,7,FApril.
OL,9,FThe rate for workers aged 21 and over
OL,10,Fis called the National Living Wage,
OL,11,Fwhile those aged 18 to 20 are paid the
OL,12,FNational Minimum Wage. They will both
OL,13,Fgo up by 3.9% next year.
OL,15,FThe rates apply across the UK.
OL,17,FFrom 1 April 2027, workers over 21 on
OL,18,Fthe National Living Wage will be paid
OL,19,F#13.21p per hour, up 50p from the
OL,20,Fcurrent #12.71 an hour.
OL,23,APub: 30-MayQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
